{"3642010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Truck-kun is Supporting Me from Another World?!", "steam_appid": 3642010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4959920], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/fdc1bdd69e676d04199fc0dbc2b79fe0.avif?t=1786558052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras_big/fdc1bdd69e676d04199fc0dbc2b79fe0.webp?t=1786558052 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/bd1b664953ba659b47aabf4f1ac5e09b.poster.avif?t=1786558052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/bd1b664953ba659b47aabf4f1ac5e09b.webm?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/bd1b664953ba659b47aabf4f1ac5e09b.mp4?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carissa Ward was all set to start her new job as the VP of marketing--until YOU hit her with your truck and transported her consciousness to a world of fantasy and magic! Rather than accept her fate, gathering a party and going on a journey of growth and self-discovery, Carissa uses all her knowledge of anime tropes and Japanese RPGs to find a different path: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/5d89dff4517f202e489fd29251482936.poster.avif?t=1786558052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/5d89dff4517f202e489fd29251482936.webm?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/5d89dff4517f202e489fd29251482936.mp4?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/e780df7db538bb017f4e7b42b1cf8cf4.avif?t=1786558052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras_big/e780df7db538bb017f4e7b42b1cf8cf4.webp?t=1786558052 width=1560 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressed into the service of the newly-incarnated buff anime elf, you'll speed your magic delivery truck to complete objectives across two worlds in a focused and flavorful OVA-sized campaign, running over pedestrians, sending them to another world as Truck-kun, and helping Carissa power up a Galactic Gate with the stars you generate together. The Skeleton King waits on the other end of the great divide, and the only way Carissa is getting home is to take a Scroll of Resurrection from his weird, dead, bony hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/17b0dec20cf910673b9cb9cd56f28b43.poster.avif?t=1786558052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/17b0dec20cf910673b9cb9cd56f28b43.webm?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/17b0dec20cf910673b9cb9cd56f28b43.mp4?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge cops, make deliveries, and smash through objects in the chaotic small town of Wenvale, USA!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives across two worlds to power up a Galactic Gate with stars and unlock a subversive, heartwarming story rooted in our love for anime. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run over pedestrians to turn them into monsters Carissa can slay for stars and XP. It's fine! Don't worry! Stop thinking about it!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energetic, ska-inspired soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (<i>Dredge</i>, <i>Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A giant, screaming man whose meat you can legally drive through.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/3c000795f614aa0234815e74e64920d3.poster.avif?t=1786558052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/3c000795f614aa0234815e74e64920d3.webm?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/3c000795f614aa0234815e74e64920d3.mp4?t=1786558052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642010/extras/fdc1bdd69e676d04199fc0dbc2b79fe0.avif?t=1786558052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamst